### The screen's two bottom lines. Each line has a wide form and a narrow one,
### for a terminal under 62 columns.

screen-draw-bottom-never-answered-wide = 還沒有人應答過這個節點
screen-draw-bottom-never-answered = 從未有人應答
screen-draw-bottom-alive-wide = 有人在應答
screen-draw-bottom-alive = 有人應答
screen-draw-bottom-waiting-wide = 下結論所需的 { $needed } 個紀元裡，已有 { $silent } 個無人應答
screen-draw-bottom-waiting = { $needed } 個中 { $silent } 個無應答
screen-draw-bottom-ended = 自紀元 { $since } 起無人應答。還有{ $years ->
       *[other] { $years } 年
    }{ $days ->
       *[other] { $days } 天
    }就消失
screen-draw-bottom-ended-and-gone = 自紀元 { $since } 起無人應答，最後的年份也已用盡

screen-draw-bottom-say-which = 說 333 中的哪一個？
screen-draw-bottom-say-keys = 回車說出 · Esc 什麼都不說

screen-draw-bottom-leave-wide = 停止節點
screen-draw-bottom-leave = 停止
screen-draw-bottom-say-wide = 說 333 中的一個
screen-draw-bottom-say = 說
screen-draw-bottom-more-wide = 其他一切
screen-draw-bottom-more = 更多
screen-draw-bottom-has-the-file = 檔案在這裡
screen-draw-bottom-not-given = 這個節點還沒拿到檔案
screen-draw-bottom-keys-wide = 所有按鍵
screen-draw-bottom-keys = 按鍵
